Filename/extension recognition adapted from SoopyCode crates/analysis/src/syntax/file_types.rs
and crates/workbench/src/file_types.rs; registration/provider selection design from
crates/workbench/src/languages.rs and crates/analysis/src/plugins/registry.rs; token
roles from crates/editor-model/src/render.rs. The extension aliases in SoopyCode
were drawn from Arborium 2.18.2 (MIT/Apache-2.0). No grammar or runtime code is included.
Pensive uses its own UTF-8 byte contracts and native model lifecycle.

